### Расширение REST Client (VS Code) / HTTP Client (PhpStorm). Замените логин в заголовке Client.
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@client = your_login

### Регистрация
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}

{ "email": "new@example.com", "name": "Тест", "password": "password123" }

### Авторизация → скопируйте token
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Список (новые сверху); сортировка: ?sort=calories&order=asc
GET {{host}}/recipes?sort=time&order=asc
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}

### Конструктор: рецепты, где есть яйца (8) и молоко (9)
GET {{host}}/recipes?ingredients[]=8&ingredients[]=9
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}

### Свои рецепты
GET {{host}}/my/recipes
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}
Authorization: Bearer ВАШ_ТОКЕН

### Удаление (чужой → 403)
DELETE {{host}}/recipes/1
Accept: application/json
Client: {{client}}
Authorization: Bearer ВАШ_ТОКЕН
